---
// Blueprint project detail
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Blueprint - Maverick Huynh</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="nav">
      <span class="nav-text">
        Sophomore at USC based in Los Angeles /
        <a href="/" class="nav-link">home</a> /
        Blueprint
      </span>
    </nav>

    <main class="project-page">
      <a href="/#projects" class="back-link">← Projects</a>

      <header class="project-header">
        <div class="project-header-top">
          <h1 class="project-title">Blueprint</h1>
          <span class="project-date">USC ACAD 406</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-intro">
          <p>
            Blueprint was an AI-powered college admissions platform built to give students personalized, data-backed guidance on strengthening their applications, built through USC's ACAD 406 purpose-driven incubator class. Our team was sectioned off to build a startup from scratch over the semester, ending with a final presentation to industry professionals and investors.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="project-meta glass-panel">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Product Lead</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Focus</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Product Strategy, Sprint Planning, AI-Driven College Admissions Guidance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Type</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Startup Incubator · Team Project</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-section glass-panel">
        <div class="section-logo">
          <img src="/images/blueprint.png" alt="Blueprint" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">What we built</h2>
        <p>
          I led product development for Blueprint, from defining the core problem to shaping the MVP direction. That meant figuring out what the platform should actually do, who it was for, and how the AI experience would come together for students and counselors, then translating that into wireframes, user flows, and product requirements the team could build against.
        </p>
        <p>
          A big part of my role was keeping the team on track. I set and tracked our deliverables, managed sprint planning, and made sure everyone stayed aligned on deadlines and responsibilities. The class itself was mostly student-led, our professor checked in on deliverables rather than handing us assignments, so a lot of the structure and accountability came from us. I ended up being the one making sure it actually held together.
        </p>
        <p>
          By the end of the semester, we presented Blueprint to industry professionals and investors, and the core idea (using real admitted-student data instead of generic advice) later evolved into a second product, Admit+.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="project-section glass-panel visuals-section">
        <div class="visuals-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="visuals-blob visuals-blob-1"></span>
          <span class="visuals-blob visuals-blob-2"></span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Project visuals</h2>
        <p>
          Screens from the Blueprint MVP: search, community profiles, application outcomes, and personalized admissions guidance.
        </p>
        <div class="visuals-grid">
          <figure class="visual-card">
            <img
              src="/images/blueprint/home.png"
              alt="Blueprint home screen with search bar and Explore Community actions"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Home: search projects and explore the community</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="visual-card">
            <img
              src="/images/blueprint/profiles.png"
              alt="Blueprint member profiles grid"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Member profiles across the community</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="visual-card">
            <img
              src="/images/blueprint/profile-detail.png"
              alt="Detailed student profile with academics, activities, and awards"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Student profile: academics, activities, and awards</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="visual-card">
            <img
              src="/images/blueprint/results.png"
              alt="Application results dashboard showing acceptances and rejections"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Application results across target schools</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="visual-card visual-card-wide">
            <img
              src="/images/blueprint/guidance.png"
              alt="Personalized guidance page with similar profiles and recommendations"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Personalized guidance from similar admitted-student profiles</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  html,
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    background-color: #f5f5f7;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: pageFadeIn 0.3s ease forwards;
  }

  @keyframes pageFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    body {
      opacity: 1;
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 2rem;
    right: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .nav-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .nav-link {
    color: #111;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .project-page {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 7.5rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .project-page::before,
  .project-page::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .back-link,
  .project-header,
  .project-meta,
  .project-section,
  .project-photo {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6e6e73;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .project-header-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .project-date {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6e6e73;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .project-intro p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3a3c;
    max-width: 46em;
  }

  .project-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .project-intro strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .glass-panel {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .project-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .project-photo {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0 0;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .project-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-photo-caption {
    margin: 0.85rem 0.35rem 0.35rem 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #86868b;
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-logo {
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 110px;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .section-logo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 110px;
    max-height: 24px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: left center;
    display: block;
  }

  .section-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .project-section p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3a3c;
  }

  .project-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .visuals-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .visuals-atmosphere {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  .visuals-blob {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(55px);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .visuals-blob-1 {
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    top: 12%;
    left: -8%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(186, 210, 255, 0.85) 0%, rgba(186, 210, 255, 0) 70%);
  }

  .visuals-blob-2 {
    width: 260px;
    height: 260px;
    bottom: 8%;
    right: -6%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(230, 200, 255, 0.75) 0%, rgba(230, 200, 255, 0) 70%);
  }

  .visuals-section > .section-title,
  .visuals-section > p,
  .visuals-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .visuals-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .visual-card {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.12),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .visual-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(
      125deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) 0%,
      transparent 35%,
      transparent 65%,
      rgba(200, 220, 255, 0.12) 100%
    );
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .visual-card-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .visual-card img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 420px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .visual-card figcaption {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0.75rem 0.2rem 0.15rem 0.2rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #3a3a3c;
  }

  .resources-panel .resource-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .resource-link {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.12),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .resource-link:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow:
      0 14px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.14),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .resource-link-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .resource-link-meta {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #6e6e73;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .nav {
      left: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    }

    .nav-text {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .project-page {
      padding: 6.5rem 1.25rem 3rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .project-header-top {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .meta-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .glass-panel {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
    }

    .visuals-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .visual-card img {
      max-height: none;
    }
  }
</style>
